{{Wireless adapter |brand=Intel |model=PRO/Wireless 5000 LAN |revision=3A Mini PCI (WM3A5000) |asin= |manuf_country= |is_manuf=No |manuf=Xircom |manuf_model= |manuf_rev= |availability=EoL |est_release_date= |fcc_date=05/24/2002 |fcc_id=J3OWM3A5000 |pcb_id=200-0941-001 |if=Mini PCI |vendor_id=168c |device_id=0007 |subvendor_id=8086 |subdevice_id=2501 |chip1_brand=Atheros |chip1_model=AR5210 |chip2_brand=Atheros |chip2_model=AR5110 |ant_conn= |802dot11_protocols=a |flags= |oui=00:05:3C |lin_driver= |win_driver= }}
"Xircom" and "200-0941-001 REV1" is silkscreened on the module.
The OUI used by this device is presumed to the standard [[Xircom]] ID :used by other early [[Intel]] devices of this era (00:05:3C).
